WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.916
Small machine. More room for ideas.

00:00:03.916 --> 00:00:05.831
This TrackWerk update keeps your handheld

00:00:05.831 --> 00:00:07.747
at the centre. and brings the

00:00:07.747 --> 00:00:09.663
sounds closer.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.712
The new sound browser groups presets

00:00:14.712 --> 00:00:17.424
by what you need. Bass. keys.

00:00:17.424 --> 00:00:20.136
pads. textures and drums. Hear a

00:00:20.136 --> 00:00:22.848
sound. star a favourite. and return

00:00:22.848 --> 00:00:25.560
to your recent choices.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:35.406
Digging is quicker. too. Supported archive

00:00:35.406 --> 00:00:37.811
MP3s can start playing while the

00:00:37.811 --> 00:00:40.217
rest downloads. Set your markers in

00:00:40.217 --> 00:00:42.622
the available audio. then take the

00:00:42.622 --> 00:00:45.028
passage into the editor.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:58.869
Keep the groove running. Hold a

00:00:58.869 --> 00:01:00.738
Punch effect. release it. then resample

00:01:00.738 --> 00:01:02.608
the performance. That little accident becomes

00:01:02.608 --> 00:01:04.477
a new instrument.

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:23.916
Keep your samples. projects and settings

00:01:23.916 --> 00:01:25.831
when you update. Preview safely. find

00:01:25.831 --> 00:01:27.747
your last folder. and call up

00:01:27.747 --> 00:01:29.663
the help when you need it.

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:42.978
And there is another way to

00:01:42.978 --> 00:01:44.957
work. TrackWerk now also has standalone

00:01:44.957 --> 00:01:46.935
builds for Linux PCs. The handheld

00:01:46.935 --> 00:01:48.913
stays in the picture. Kid Bunka.

00:01:48.913 --> 00:01:50.892
TrackWerk.
